    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight protobuf wire format parser. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This implements protobuf wire format parsing without requiring protobuf library dependency, suitable for embedded use in the wire protocol server.</para>
<para>Wire Format:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Varint encoding for integers</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Length-delimited for strings/bytes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Tag = (field_number &lt;&lt; 3) | wire_type </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
